# Terraform
# State files record real infrastructure and often contain values that should
# not be public. tfvars holds whatever was parameterised, which is where
# secrets end up. The provider cache is large and machine specific.
**.tfvars
**.tfstate
**.tfstate.*
**/.terraform/
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Credentials and keys. Nothing here should ever be committed.
.env
*.pem
*.key
credentials

# Compiled Go binary. Produced by go build, rebuilt by the Dockerfile.
src/product-service

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Docker image archives
*.tar

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Note on what is deliberately NOT ignored:
#   terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl  is committed on purpose. It pins provider
#   versions so that anyone who clones this repo gets the same providers.
#   locust/*.csv                   are experiment results, part of the writeup.
#   screenshots/                   are deliverables.
